_before': True, 'referrals': [], 'note': 'Their most recent visit was December 2025. Four visits across general practice and orthopaedics, with no one regular doctor. Their history runs across Arenal Sur, Arenal Centro and Arenal Norte; do not assume which one they mean. Books for a partner as often as for themselves; settle who the patient is.', 'matched_on': ['name']}, {'patient_id': 'P02437', 'name': 'Andrea Molina Álvarez', 'date_of_birth': '1963-04-24', 'insurer': 'sanitas', 'has_visited_before': False, 'referrals': ['dermatology', 'orthopaedics'], 'note': 'Never been seen here; two first visits are already booked, the first of them with Dr. Pablo Requena. Read the appointment back before ending the call; they check it and will not ask.', 'matched_on': ['name']}, {'patient_id': 'P01596', 'name': 'Rosa Medina Navarro', 'date_of_birth': '1993-07-24', 'insurer': 'adeslas', 'has_visited_before': True, 'referrals': ['orthopaedics'], 'note': 'Still attending; the last visit was December 2025. Three visits on the chart, spread across gynaecology, general practice and orthopaedics. Their history runs across Arenal Centro and Arenal Sur; do not assume which one they mean. Answers before the question is finished; check they heard the whole of it.', 'matched_on': ['name']}, {'patient_id': 'P02040', 'name': 'Nuria Martínez Álvarez', 'date_of_birth': '1949-03-08', 'insurer': 'caser', 'has_visited_before': True, 'referrals': ['dermatology', 'physiotherapy'], 'note': 'An old patient of the clinic; nothing since July 2024. One visit only, with Dr. Pablo Requena. Will ask about parking and the walk from the door.', 'matched_on': ['name']}, {'patient_id': 'P02380', 'name': 'Ana Martín Álvarez', 'date_of_birth': '1994-11-12', 'insurer': 'sanitas', 'has_visited_before': False, 'referrals': ['dermatology', 'orthopaedics', 'physiotherapy'], 'note': 'Never been seen here; five first visits are already booked, the first of them with Dra. Elena Iglesias. Holds a referral for Dermatology; no need to ask whether they have one. Rings from work; keep it short and confirm once.', 'matched_on': ['name']}, {'patient_id': 'P00793', 'name': 'Antonia Muñoz Álvarez', 'date_of_birth': '2009-01-22', 'insurer': 'adeslas', 'has_visited_before': True, 'referrals': ['dermatology', 'physiotherapy'], 'note': 'Lapsed -- the chart stops at July 2024. Seven visits, nearly all of them with Dra. Nuria Peral. Will ask what is available soonest before anything else.', 'matched_on': ['name']}], 'count': 10}
